<td id="S3.T1.2.4.6" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center"><span id="S3.T1.2.4.6.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">83.52</span></td></tr>
<tr id="S3.T1.2.5" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="S3.T1.2.5.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left"><span id="S3.T1.2.5.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">OpenCLIP <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite">[<a href="#bib.bibx7" title="" class="ltx_ref">Ilharco et al.(2021)Ilharco, Wortsman, Wightman, Gordon, Carlini, Taori, Dave, Shankar, Namkoong, Miller, Hajishirzi, Farhadi, and Schmidt</a>]</cite></span></td>
