Toyota Motor Europe and CTU student grant SGS23/173/OHK3/3T/13. Jiri Matas recieved support from the Technology Agency of the
Czech Republic, project No. SS73020004. The access to the computational infrastructure of the OP VVV funded project CZ.02.1.01/0.0/0.0/16_019/0000765 “Research Center for Informatics” is also gratefully acknowledged.</p>
</div>
